    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμᾰτ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>looking like blood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαχωρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prog.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρυγξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.49
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				342a36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.4.6
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of the nature of blood, bloody</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					726b32
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				665b7
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαχώρησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diocl. Fr.
					147
				</span></i>
			.</div>
